 complete for every node: each has a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by the fixed lifecycle observations, and recovered service, data, and size-3 cluster state. Hygiene is reduced by the superseded three-node MariaDB 10.0 installation and the briefly unsigned repository configuration.","limitations":["The fixed after-executor listening-socket observations are empty on all nodes, despite task-specific checks shortly beforehand directly showing MariaDB listening on each managed address. The generic collector output provides insufficient detail to reconcile this discrepancy (global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets, global:after_executor:node2:listening-sockets, global:after_executor:node3:listening-sockets, cmd-d1d41a6b97424229, cmd-400253e077ac49b0, cmd-6135f87fe23f4c54).","No complete final package inventory was captured, so the evidence confirms removal/replacement of the MariaDB 10.0 server/client/core packages and healthy dpkg state but cannot determine whether any dependencies installed only by the superseded attempt remained."]}
